<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK O/N REPO AVE YIELD 32.95PCT (72.37PCT).</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK O/N REPO AVE YIELD 32.95PCT (72.37PCT).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield in a Czech National Bank (CNB) overnight repo tender held on Tuesday dropped to 32.95 percent from 72.37 in the last similar operation on May 26, a CNB statement said.</p>
